Subject: [PATCH] test(claude-eval): G220-2/3 contract against the real
 JournalUpsertWorker and WAIT/review separation

Five scenarios not pinned by tests/test_worker_journal.py, with real Markdown
and in-memory Qdrant. Two kill mutants that survive GPT's suite: removing the
final rights check or the final canonical check before INDEXED on the
lost-ack recovery path. Preflight/prepare: in-flight WAIT is waiting only;
review blocks candidates of the same preview; deletes always review;
MARK_PUBLISHED never an index proposal.

